\r\n\r\nProperty Site: https://view.paradym.com/v/509-Dimple-Street-Killeen-TX-76541/4877629\r\n\r\n509 Dimple Street\r\nKilleen, TX 76541\r\n$165,000, 3 bed, 2.00 bath, 936 SF, MLS# 551706\r\n\r\nWelcome Home! This cute freshly painted three bedroom two bath well maintained home would be great for first time homebuyers, a military family coming in that would like to live close to base or those looking to pick up a rental property for some passive income. Walking under the covered porch and entering through the front door takes you into the spacious living room with the kitchen and dining area located just beyond it. You will find the large inside laundry room making the connection between the kitchen and garage. On the opposite side of the house, you will come across all three good sized bedrooms, one bathroom off the hall and the other bathroom off the main. The electrical and plumbing have had updates. An AC unit was installed for the garage to regulate the temperature in there for those times you have a larger gathering with overflow into the garage or would like to work out of it. Come see all the advantages this home will do for you today!\r\n\r\n2 full bath\r\n\r\nFor more information, please contact: \r\nCasey Gregg\r\nCENTURY 21 Premier Realtors\r\n254-278-9044 or kc21properties@gmail.com\r\n\r\nYou can also text 3621 to 46835\r\nSearch All Listings: https://kc21properties.com/current-listings\r\n\r\nAGENT SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: https://kc21properties.com\r\nShowcase: https://view.paradym.com/s/Casey-Gregg-CENTURY-21-Premier-Realtors/282956\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100078731741938\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/kc21properties\r\n\r\nCOMPANY SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: https://www.forthoodrealestate.com/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Century21PremierRealtors/\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/c21pbroker\r\nLinkedIn: https://www.Linkedin.com/in/hrherrings/\r\nPinterest: https://www.pinteres